<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio | Backend Developer</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 font-sans antialiased">

    <header class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r blue-400 from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                &lt;Dev.Dev /&gt;
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700">
                Available for Hire
            </span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 space-y-12">
        
        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
                Hi, I'm <span class="text-cyan-400">Fazil</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 font-medium">Backend Developer</p>
            <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-justify">
                My strength lies in developing scalable and maintainable web applications with strong expertise in <strong>PHP (Laravel)</strong>, <strong>Node.js</strong>, <strong>REST API development</strong>, and relational databases such as <strong>MySQL</strong> and <strong>SQL Server</strong>. I also have experience in building backend architectures, optimizing application performance, and collaborating across teams to deliver reliable end-to-end solutions. Additionally, I have hands-on experience working with <strong>React.js</strong> for frontend development and understand modern software development practices including version control, testing, and Agile methodologies.
            </p>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-slate-800" />

        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200">Tech Stack & Expertise</h2>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">Node.js</span>
                <span class="bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">PHP (Laravel)</span>
                <span class="bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">REST API</span>
                <span class="bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">MySQL</span>
                <span class="bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">SQL Server</span>
                <span class="bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">React.js</span>
                <span class="bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">Flutter</span>
                <span class="bg-slate-700/50 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">Git / Version Control</span>
                <span class="bg-slate-700/50 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium">Agile Methodologies</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-slate-800" />

        <section class="bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200">What I Bring to Your Team</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">If I join the company, here is how I will contribute:</p>
            </div>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 mt-1">✔</span>
                    <span>Building and maintaining high-quality web applications that align with business needs, ensuring clean and efficient code implementation.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 mt-1">✔</span>
                    <span>Supporting continuous improvement of existing systems to optimize stability and scalability.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 mt-1">✔</span>
                    <span>Actively participating in application testing, documentation, and cross-team collaboration.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-200 mb-2">Future Growth & Adaptability</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-justify text-sm">
                    I am eager to expand my contribution into full-stack responsibilities, including frontend enhancement and mobile application development using Flutter, while continuously learning and adapting to support team goals and business growth.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-slate-800 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <p>&copy; 2026. Built with Node.js & Tailwind CSS.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>